    },
    {
      "id": "gpt-6-2-effort",
      "text": "For a new API integration, start at medium; replace none or minimal with low. Both 6.2 models need Responses for tools; omit sampling and log-probability options.",
      "applies": [
        "gpt-6.2-astra",
